00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:53.090
So it's both ways.

00:03:53.090 --> 00:03:54.280
But it's transparency.

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:55.480
So salary is the next level.

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:57.100
Then you have profits.

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:58.100
What's profits?

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:00.480
Somebody who's getting paid salary, plus profits.

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:03.440
Why is this important to give somebody salary
